OL,3,GNEWSARecord heat leaves flower growers
OL,4,Ashort of blooms
OL,5,
OL,6,FMet Office provisional figures put
OL,7,Fsummer 2026 as the UK's warmest since
OL,8,Frecords began in 1884, with a mean
OL,9,Ftemperature of 16.5C (61.7F), above the
OL,10,F16.10C (61F) record set last year.
